      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Still fuming over his phone call with Elena, Viktor Petrovich nods absently while the wedding organizer lists specific dishes for the banquet. When Vika notices he is not writing anything down, the Chef waves her off and boasts that as head chef he has a memory like an elephant.",
